### Design Rationale Summary:

| Task | Rule Type | Why |
|------|-----------|-----|
| find birch_fence_gate | `position_near_with_facing` | Preferred for find/locate tasks per the preference order (#4). Models "player can see the target" by requiring proximity + facing direction. Target at (7,0,4) matches the `/setblock ~7 ~0 ~4` command. |
| mine birch_trapdoor | `inventory_has` | Preferred for mine tasks per the preference order (#1). Birch trapdoors drop themselves when broken. Player starts with 0 birch_trapdoor items, so min_count=1 is a clean signal. |

